{"c":[{"name":"20261017T012636Z-cb621eb5522291ae","text":"sr-initialize Step 2: an install-shaped copy outside the default plugins folders is claude when installed_plugins.json beside its cache/ holds the quoted exact plugin root (grep -qF), checked before CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT; else no owner. Supersedes the round-1 owner-rule note.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261017T014809Z-c4ddf9bb24e2c594","text":"Correction: relative-path plugins in a local-path Claude Code marketplace get a cache entry and an install record, but load in place from the source folder (claude plugin list --json readFromFolder). installPath is not always the folder a plugin loads from.","type":"note"}]}
